The handover trigger condition based on A3RSRP HDMA is that the RSRP of the target gNB is greater than a threshold of the current base station RSRP within a short period of time; the handover trigger condition based on UE speed HDMA in referenc~\cite{8650068} and~\cite{8622167} are that when the UE movement is greater than a threshold, the UE data transmission is fixed to the macro base station to ensure the seamless communication.


