\subsection*{Conventions}\label{ss:conv}

We assume the reader is familiar with~\cite{ttg-sm}
and follow the same conventions.
For a presentable \(\infty\)-category~\(\cat{C}\),
we write \(\cat{C}_{\kappa}\) for the full subcategory
