nce between the Fano factors of total nuclear mRNA and protein at $S=2$ and $S=12$ steps of nuclear mRNA processing (computed using the exact LNA). The blue line $y=x$ is a visual aid, showing that the dependence of the Fano factor of protein noise on $S$ is comparable or weaker than that of total nuclear mRNA (Proposition~\ref{prop_pro_FF}). See main text for parameter values.}
