&= \{ F=AG \in \mathcal{F} \mid A \in R^{m \times n}\ \text{is left regular over $R$}\}. \end{aligned} \]
We will use this representation to construct a dense subset $\mathcal{V} \subset \mathcal{F}_0$ consisting of elements of the form $F =AG$ with left regular matrices $A$ (Proposition \ref{prop:enough_condition_of_output}, Theorem \ref{thm:density_of_outputs}).
