    \caption{Median non-linear time dependence at the level of different components. Volatility clustering (left) and leverage effect (right) is confirmed in original asset returns and more strongly observed in factor-based returns with exponential $\propto a e^{-\gamma}$ and power law $\propto a x^{-\gamma}$ fits, respectively. Grey areas represent 95\% bootstrap confidence interval for an i.i.d sample of the length of the training set from a standard Student-t with 3 degrees of freedom.}%
