\caption{
Starting from a text prompt, our method generates 3D scenes leveraging a 360\degree{} panoramic image as intermediate representation to extract, reconstruct and compose objects in the environment. Our scenes,  represented as 3D Gaussian splats, support long-range exploration and have high structural coherence even under large camera offsets. This improves immersive scene generation for existing applications, enables intuitive object-level editing and makes them strong 3D priors for world-to-world transfer models \cite{cosmos}.
}
\label{fig:teaser}
\end{teaserfigure}

